# Tokens, CSS files, and strict TypeScript

## Tokens (required)

All colors, fonts, radii, spacing, and focus rings live in **`component-lib-frontend/styles/tokens.css`** as `--*` variables. Never hard-code hex/rgb in components.

Change the theme by editing tokens only (or `/theme` overrides that write to `:root`).

## CSS layout (required)

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `styles/tokens.css` | Variables only |
| `styles/fields/*.css` | Reusable field styles (vanilla + React) |
| `styles/components/*.css` | Button, badge, label, form-field shell |
| `styles/index.css` | Imports all partials |
| `styles/globals.css` | App entry: Tailwind + tokens + index |

**Do not** put presentation in long Tailwind strings on primitives. Use classes such as `ui-field-control`, `ui-input`, `ui-btn--primary`.

New field type → add `styles/fields/<name>.css` and import it in `index.css`.

Vanilla HTML example:

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="tokens.css" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="fields/field-shared.css" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="fields/input.css" />
<input class="ui-field-control ui-input" />
```

## TypeScript (required)

- Components live under `src/components/ui/` as `.tsx` + `index.ts`.
- Shared prop types: **`src/types/fields.ts`** (`FieldSize`, `FieldStatus`, `BaseFieldControlProps`, `ButtonVariant`, etc.).
- Class name helpers: **`src/components/ui/styles.ts`** (`fieldControlClass`, `inputClass`, `buttonClass`) — thin mapping to CSS classes only.
- Extend native HTML attribute types with `Omit<..., "size">` when `size` is the design-system enum.
- `className` always last in `cn()`.

## Checklist for new/changed primitives

- [ ] Tokens used (no ad-hoc colors in TSX)
- [ ] Styles in `styles/fields/` or `styles/components/`
- [ ] Props typed via `src/types/fields.ts`
- [ ] Storybook + `tsc` + `npm run build`
